    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Simultaneity and manner",
     "texto": [
      "**Camminando, ho visto Anna** (while walking, I saw Anna); **Ha passato la serata leggendo** (he spent the evening reading).",
      "Usually the subject of the gerund is the same as the subject of the main clause."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Cause and pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "**Essendo in ritardo, ho preso un taxi** (as I was late, I took a taxi). The pronoun goes after the verb: **leggendolo** (reading it), **chiedendoglielo** (asking him/her for it).",
      "Avoid leaving the implied subject of the gerund unclear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
